message: "If you use this workflow or code, please cite this repository."
title: "Wastewater Hybrid-Capture Viromics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Huang"
    given-names: "Qi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qihuang627-creator/wastewater-capture-viromics"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - wastewater viromics
  - hybrid capture
  - viral metagenomics
  - wastewater surveillance
  - genome reconstruction
  - Snakemake
  - viral genomics
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational workflow for hybrid-capture wastewater
  viromics integrating de novo viral discovery, assembly-supported detection,
  competitive mapping, sequence annotation, multisample evidence integration,
  genome reconstruction, phylogenetic analysis, and diagnostic
  oligonucleotide mismatch surveillance.
